    cursor, and the last 5 syncs. No cursor, a bad one, or a log that was rotated or cut: its last 200, reset true."""
    out = {"events": [], "cursor": "0-0", "reset": True, "syncs": syncs(5)}
    got = opened(os.path.join(STATE, "events.jsonl"), STATE)
